    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nīdĭfĭco</span></b> ,
			āre, v. n.
		nidus-facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to build a nest</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nidificant aves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 15, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8, 8, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sola piscium nidificat ex algā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 26, 42, § 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turdi luto nidificantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 53, 74, § 147</span></i>
			.—Prov.: sic vos non vobis nidificatis aves, Verg.
			ap. Don. Vit. <i><span class="en">Verg. 17</span></i>.</div>
